cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "SAADE-AUA: Scenario-Adaptive Audio Deepfake Evaluation on Ukrainian Speech"
abstract: >-
  Source code for Scenario-Adaptive Audio Deepfake Evaluation (SAADE) on the
  Ukrainian AUA corpus. The project evaluates pretrained synthetic speech
  detectors (AASIST, AASIST-L, Wav2Vec2) across 21 acoustic scenarios: a clean
  baseline plus noise, MP3 compression, reverberation and low-pass filtering,
  each at five severity levels. No models are trained. The repository contains
  the five-step evaluation pipeline, including text-matched REAL-TTS pair
  generation, an ONNX/PyTorch reference parity audit, repeat-padding correction
  and a frozen one-time hidden test protocol, together with dataset audits and
  archived development releases.
